# The collision one import deep: this file is clean, but the module it
# imports (use_import_clobber) redefines a name it imports itself. Must
# refuse E-NAME-022 naming that module, never scope the two copies so
# the inner module's bodies call the wrong one.
use use_import_clobber

emath function calls_through:
    inputs:
        x: Rat
    outputs:
        result: Rat
    definitions:
        result = clobber_shared(x)
